# Web App Infrastructure

## DNS Nameservers

Add the following AWS nameservers to your domain registrar so the Route 53 settings are applied:

- ns-1147.awsdns-15.org
- ns-161.awsdns-20.com
- ns-1629.awsdns-11.co.uk
- ns-876.awsdns-45.net

## Architecture

![Web app architecture](architecture.png)

## Notes

- AWS EC2 security groups block inbound traffic by default. A security group rule must be added using the EC2 instance's IP address to allow inbound access.
- Connect to the PostgreSQL database using the following command:

  ```bash
  psql -U foo -d mydb -p 5432 -h terraform-20210127022433201300000001.cr2ub9wmsmpg.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com